WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.520
Everyone, like, Kaleido Star is about to start.

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.190
When you watch Kaleido Star,
please keep your room brightly lit,

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:08.560
and sit as far from the TV as you can. 'Kay?

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:09.520
Let's go!

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:12.020
Well, well, well.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.230
Have you ever made up your mind
about something?

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:17.100
Many things have happened in my 16-year life.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.830
I challenged a lots of things.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:22.100
But this time I'm earnest. I'm serious.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.040
I made up my mind in a super serious mode.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.710
I'm going to take the challenge
for everyone's future!

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.230
For everyone's future! For everyone's future!

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:35.320
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be someplace</i>

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:35.320
<i>Dare mo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.820
<i>It has to be somewhere</i>

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.820
<i>Dokoka ni aru</i>

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja nai</i>

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:59.880
<i>Remember how I used to say
I could make it to the end?</i>

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:59.880
<i>Saigo made yareru to ittetane</i>

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:06.250
<i>I must have been pretending to be tough</i>

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:06.250
<i>Kitto tsuyogatte itanda</i>

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:14.960
<i>Everything I did was reckless
and it never got me anywhere</i>

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:14.960
<i>Itsudatte muchabakka de
zutto karamawari de</i>

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:21.490
<i>But you alone were always beside me</i>

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:21.490
<i>Dakedo anata dake ga soba ni ita</i>

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:28.200
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be somewhere</i>

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:28.200
<i>Daremo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.810
<i>You can start going forward</i>

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.810
<i>Aruki daseru</i>

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:36.350
<i>From this moment, something will start</i>

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:36.350
<i>Koko kara nani kaga hajimaru</i>

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:38.380
<i>I want to believe that</i>

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:38.380
<i>Shinjite itai</i>

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:45.890
<i>The light I haven't seen yet
is beaming toward the promised place</i>

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:45.890
<i>Mada minu hikari yakusoku no
basho e to tsuzuite yuku</i>

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:56.360
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:56.360
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja naisa</i>

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:03.570
What?

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:07.030
Hm? What? What?

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:16.180
Can you see me?

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:18.690
"The Legendary Amazing Maneuver"

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:21.320
The Legendary Amazing Maneuver

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:21.320
"The Legendary Amazing Maneuver"

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:24.620
The Legendary Amazing Maneuver

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.100
Wait, Sora.

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:32.130
What's wrong with you?

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:34.840
So, you can see him too, right?

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.240
What?

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:37.630
I'm talking about Fool...

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:41.670
Fool?

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:44.650
My name is Fool.

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:45.840
I am the spirit of the stage.

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:49.580
Uh...

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:53.150
As I expected, Layla's so calm.

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:59.020
Oh, no...

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:04.100
So, did I lose my mind, is that it?

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:06.000
I think he's the one who lost his mind.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:06.800
What?!

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:09.170
But, Miss Layla,

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:10.500
you couldn't see him before.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:14.130
Layla was chosen for the stage just now.

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:19.710
It is proof that you can attempt
the legendary great maneuver.

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:22.250
The legendary great maneuver?

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:26.050
It was tried once, a long time ago.

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:29.250
After that, no one has successfully
performed that maneuver.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:32.090
One person was frightened.

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:35.590
Another challenged it recklessly
and lost his life.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:38.400
If you're going to attempt that maneuver,

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.960
you will be the second pair to try
from Kaleido Stage.

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:43.510
The second pair?

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:45.710
In order to challenge
the legendary great maneuver,

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:47.900
it needs two stars.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:50.180
What happened to the two
who tried before and failed?

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:52.150
They died.

00:03:57.190 --> 00:04:00.520
One partner could not see me,

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:04.490
but the other one told me a lie
and made him pretend he could see me.

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:07.020
But, Miss Layla can see you.

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:09.460
So, please tell me, Fool.

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:12.830
What kind of maneuver is this
"legendary great maneuver"?

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:15.200
I cannot tell you yet.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.410
What?

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:19.370
Until both of you are
qualified for that maneuver.

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:20.570
Qualified?

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:24.350
When is that? How can we be qualified?

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:26.650
Even I don't know that.

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:28.320
It could be tomorrow,

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:29.780
it could be ten years from now.

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:32.120
Don't be so mean. Just tell us now.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.610
If you try that maneuver now...

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:43.620
An avatar of Death...

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:47.490
I'm afraid at least one of you will die.

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:57.450
But l...

00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:00.640
I think I can do it
if it's with you, Miss Layla!

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:07.360
Let me think about it.

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:08.480
What?

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:11.830
Ouch!

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:14.850
Miss Layla, I will do my best!

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:18.630
Miss Layla...

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:23.660
Am I not good enough for you?

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:28.840
As we thought, the masked star
was Miss Layla.

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:29.910
Yes.

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:31.080
Since we have a time difference,

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:32.950
if she leaves London
first thing in the morning,

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:34.810
she can be here by noon.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:40.480
I want to try the legendary great maneuver
with Miss Layla by any means.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.920
The legendary great maneuver?

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:43.820
What's that?

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:48.230
Even I don't know what it is,

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:53.270
but I think I can do any kind of maneuver
if I do it with Miss Layla.

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:54.790
But...

00:05:57.740 --> 00:06:00.710
Hi, everyone, please come close
and take a look!

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:04.680
Like, the best show in history, kinda,
is going to start!

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:07.710
C'mon, c'mon!

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:10.220
Anyway, did you hear?

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:12.650
They found out that the
masked star was Miss Layla.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:14.490
I'd, you know, rather work with them.

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:20.360
After all, I realized that I want
to appear on stage with Miss Layla.

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:22.560
Don't you think it's like, too late to realize that?

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:24.360
Of course, I feel the same, but...

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:27.740
The small audience must have something to do
with the fact that we don't have Miss Layla.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:28.970
It has to be.

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:30.670
If you don't like it here, you can leave.

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:33.380
Both of you are fired.

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:36.210
What?

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:37.250
Oh, well.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:38.300
It's, like, probably better for us.

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:45.050
It's Yuri.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.390
Kaleido Stage's...

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:48.060
Not only that...

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:49.090
What? That's...

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:49.160
Layla!

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:49.160
What? That's...

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:49.490
Layla!

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:49.990
Layla!

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:49.990
I didn't think you'd come.

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:50.090
I didn't think you'd come.

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.330
I heard she will appear on screen again.

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.330
I didn't think you'd come.

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:51.720
I didn't think you'd come.

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:54.760
How is the movie shoot?

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:57.090
Finished without a hitch.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:59.030
That's good.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.590
So, what did you want to talk about?

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:06.270
I want you to come back, Layla.

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:09.910
I want to appear on stage with you again.

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:12.810
You're the only partner I have.

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:17.380
My current partner is Sora.

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:23.860
I may attempt the
legendary great maneuver with Sora.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:30.390
You're going to attempt the
legendary great maneuver with Sora?!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:31.930
There is no way you can do that.

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:33.260
Absolutely not!

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:35.470
Yuri...

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:38.740
And if you're going to do it,
then I'll do it with you!

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:42.010
You're not qualified.

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:44.980
Really...

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:03.160
When I saw the Kaleido Stage for the first time,

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:05.860
it was truly like a dream.

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:15.300
I wished I could also appear on that stage.

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:17.070
After I started grade school,

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:20.280
and when I started learning gymnastics,
I thought it was fun.

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:23.050
For the first time in my life,

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:25.490
I learned how good applause made me feel.

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:29.220
I would practice very hard every day
on a maneuver that I couldn't do.

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:30.490
And when I was finally able to do it,
when I received applause,

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:33.430
I'd feel so happy, I would tremble.

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:37.800
When I got applause on stage
for the first time,

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:39.100
it really made me happy.

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:42.300
That's why I want to try
even more amazing maneuvers.

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:45.230
That's why I want to perform
even more amazing performances.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:54.310
I want to show them.

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:55.850
I want them to see it.

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:59.980
And I want to perform on that stage
with Miss Layla.

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:14.930
The legendary great maneuver?

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:18.240
I'm sure Kalos knows something.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:20.400
About people who took the challenge before
or something like that...

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:21.580
Okay...

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.410
but I don't know if
he's willing to talk about it.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:26.410
He's never said anything about it
to anybody before.

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:28.910
Even if challengers are Sora and myself?

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:33.760
Well, if it's the two of you,
it should be all right.

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.810
I'll give you Kalos' contact information.

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:39.130
Oh, damn! I wasn't watching!

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:41.750
Master, please do it again!

00:09:43.130 --> 00:09:45.100
Can you wait for a second, Layla?

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:46.100
Yes.

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:50.640
You sure work hard every day, Sora.

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:53.070
Well, I have no choice but to practice.

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:56.310
So I will be accepted as Miss Layla's partner.

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:58.180
Sora, is this true?

00:09:58.510 --> 00:09:59.170
What?

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:02.150
"Layla Hamilton and Sora Naegino

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:03.950
return to their old home, Kaleido Stage,

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:06.850
to risk their lives challenging
the legendary great maneuver."

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:08.990
Wow...

00:10:09.390 --> 00:10:10.220
It says next month.

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:12.590
You must be kidding.

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:16.590
Who are you?

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:17.600
Excuse me,

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:21.500
that announcement about the legendary great
maneuver being performed at Kaleido Stage...

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:24.610
Those tickets are already sold out.

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:25.800
What?

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:27.880
Excuse me, Miss!

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:30.550
I'm the one performing in that show!

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:31.340
What?

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:33.080
Good morning, Sora.

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:33.880
Mr. Yuri...

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:36.720
Those tickets are completely sold out.

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:39.090
If you need them, I'll prepare
reserved seats for invited guests.

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:40.290
So just let me know the number of people...

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:40.920
How do you know about
the legendary great maneuver?

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:40.920
So just let me know the number of people...

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:42.920
How do you know about
the legendary great maneuver?

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:44.390
I heard it from Layla.

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:45.690
What?

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:50.400
Then Miss Layla agreed to challenge
the legendary great maneuver! Is that right?

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:52.760
Yuri announced it without consulting us.

00:10:55.870 --> 00:10:59.470
Do you want to make laughingstocks out of us?

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:02.510
I'm just paying my respect to those who are
going to challenge a very difficult maneuver,

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:05.270
and I decided to offer the stage.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.880
If you want to back out of this,
you should do it now.

00:11:07.880 --> 00:11:10.420
You can quit anytime.

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:14.820
All sold tickets are non-refundable.

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:16.590
The only people who lose money
are the audience.

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:17.390
You can't!

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:20.590
We're not going to cancel.

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:25.000
But we have a condition of our own.

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:26.330
A condition?

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:29.100
If we succeed in performing
the legendary great maneuver,

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:31.660
I want you to return Kaleido Stage to us!

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:35.180
All right.

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:36.680
I'm counting on you.

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:39.550
I expect you to perfect
the maneuver without a hitch.

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:46.850
Miss Layla!

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:49.860
I made up my mind too.

00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:52.730
Sora, no matter what happens,

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:56.930
I'm going to perfect the
legendary great maneuver with you.

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:04.160
And we're going to make sure to show
that maneuver to the audience on this stage.

00:12:04.310 --> 00:12:05.740
Yes.

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:09.210
Oh, but if we don't know
what kind of maneuver it is,

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:10.910
we don't know how we should practice.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:13.180
Kalos knows how we should practice.

00:12:13.180 --> 00:12:14.620
Boss does?

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:16.780
He used to watch the two previous
challengers practice.

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:22.320
He said if we are serious about doing this,
come to the Grand Canyon.

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:24.790
He said he's going to give us
special training there.

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:26.260
You're going, right, Sora?

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:29.730
Of course I'm going!

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:35.870
Is he really going to give us
Kaleido Stage back?

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:36.700
Yes.

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:39.410
For everyone's sake, I'm going to
perfect that maneuver by all means.

00:12:39.410 --> 00:12:41.880
And I'm going to get back
our Kaleido Stage!

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.040
So, Boss is coaching...

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:45.410
Good luck, Sora!

00:12:45.550 --> 00:12:47.570
Here, Jonathan. You cheer for her too!

00:12:48.820 --> 00:12:50.440
We will go see your performance.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.480
I kept hounding them for tickets,
and I already got some.

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:56.790
I'm going with you!

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:57.590
What?

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:02.200
I'll also participate as your special trainer.

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:03.500
Ken...

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:05.300
Me too.

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:07.190
Then I'm going too!

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:08.670
Why don't we all go together?

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:09.440
Yeah!

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:09.940
That's impossible!

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:09.940
Yeah!

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:10.730
That's impossible!

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:36.060
So, Boss knows what kind of maneuver that
the legendary great maneuver is.

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:37.330
Don't forget.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:40.200
Finding out what it is
without being qualified means...

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:41.640
I know.

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:43.000
You want to say "It's dangerous."

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:45.610
We're going to help you.

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:47.070
Aren't you kinda glad?

00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:48.670
Well...

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:50.250
Sora...

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:52.980
I'm going to do my best to support you.

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:55.180
But...

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:59.250
if the legendary great maneuver
is really that dangerous,

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:01.160
I'm going to stop you.

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:02.490
Ken...

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:04.750
Because I don't want to lose you, Sora.

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:18.470
Welcome.

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:19.300
It's been awhile.

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:21.870
Boss...

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:24.810
Are you ready?

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:29.850
I have a hunch something bad will happen.

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:31.290
What?

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:33.760
I e-mailed everybody who used
to work for Kaleido Stage,

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:36.490
and asked them about the maneuver.

00:14:36.490 --> 00:14:40.130
They told me that there were people who
challenged that maneuver ten years ago, and...

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:41.330
And what happened?

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:42.960
They died.

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:48.460
I wonder, could that be...

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:01.650
Like, cook this one next.

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:04.420
Can you taste this?

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:05.250
Well?

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:08.020
Hm... It, like, doesn't taste very good.

00:15:08.890 --> 00:15:11.050
Then why don't you help me?

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:13.590
Because I'm not, like,
really good at stuff like this.

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:29.740
Once you finish that,
do 100 one arm chin-ups.

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.110
No rest!

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:00.130
Sora...

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:07.970
Oh, my...

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.150
Jump.

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:10.280
What!

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:46.610
So, today's training is finished.

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:47.960
Not yet!

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:50.450
Sora, do 100 bicep curls
with your right hand.

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:54.290
Do it!

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:56.700
Yes, sir.

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:08.810
Do you want me to cut it for you?

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:13.750
Thank you, but I'll be okay.

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:14.770
I'll keep at it, on my own.

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:16.750
Sora...

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:26.190
What?

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:27.160
No way...

00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:28.890
A maneuver like that can't be possible...

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:31.470
In order to perfect the maneuver,

00:17:31.470 --> 00:17:34.830
he said that he needed absolute confidence.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.240
Who is "he"?

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:38.740
This doesn't just apply to those two.

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:41.170
It also applies to everybody around them.

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:43.810
If you can trust both Sora and Layla,

00:17:43.810 --> 00:17:46.610
never show your uncertainty
or be soft on them until the end.

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:50.550
If you cannot trust them,
you should leave here right now.

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:51.350
Because you will get in their way.

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:54.760
And also,

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:59.230
don't tell Sora what
the legendary great maneuver is.

00:17:59.230 --> 00:18:02.750
We don't have that right.

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:09.700
Does it hurt?

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:11.370
But please bear it.

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:13.570
I have to make sure to
loosen your muscles very well.

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:16.610
Tomorrow, we'll have an interval
by letting you do some light workouts,

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:17.780
and then the day after tomorrow...

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:17.950
Ken...

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:17.950
and then the day after tomorrow...

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:18.570
Ken...

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:23.980
I wonder if I can endure
this kind of training till the end.

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:27.960
I wonder if I'm capable of doing
the legendary great maneuver.

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:31.460
Sora is growing uncertain.

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:45.830
Good.

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:55.580
We've been doing the same training
for over a week.

00:18:56.380 --> 00:18:57.350
Don't complain.

00:18:58.090 --> 00:18:59.050
You have no choice but to do it.

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:00.990
Ken...

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:03.180
You sound like a different person.

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:05.230
You too, Sora. Don't be so soft.

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:08.390
You're the one who told me you're
going to do the legendary great maneuver.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:10.660
That's true.

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:15.140
Layla, you've completed the first level.

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:17.930
You're going to start training
using a rope starting tomorrow.

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:19.400
Yes!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:21.360
Sora, come here.

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:23.070
Yes.

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:29.320
The iron ball hanging at the end of that wire

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:31.810
weighs almost the same as Layla.

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:35.620
Catch this using only your right arm
and push it back.

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:38.330
If you can't do this,

00:19:38.330 --> 00:19:40.190
you can't be Layla's partner.

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:41.390
Can you do it?

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:44.060
Yes, I will.

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:48.070
If you can trust both Sora and Layla,

00:19:48.070 --> 00:19:51.270
never show your uncertainty
or be soft on them until the end.

00:19:53.470 --> 00:19:54.770
Please wait for a second.

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:56.210
What?

00:19:56.880 --> 00:20:00.210
Please let me handle this training.

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:01.180
Ken...

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:03.640
Are you capable of doing this?

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:05.980
Yes.

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:08.720
Are you ready, Sora?

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:09.820
Yes.

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:20.090
One more time!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:33.700
C'mon!

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:40.380
Sora, stand up!

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:43.590
Next!

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:48.090
Next!

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:03.240
This is nothing...

00:21:05.710 --> 00:21:07.010
By any means...

00:21:07.010 --> 00:21:11.470
By any means, I'm going to do the
legendary great maneuver with Miss Layla.

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:13.320
Sora, stand up!

00:21:13.320 --> 00:21:16.480
Unless you can do this,
you can't perfect the legendary great maneuver!

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:22.390
Yes...

00:21:23.400 --> 00:21:28.730
What kind of maneuver
is the legendary great maneuver?

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:45.450
Without knowing what kind of maneuver it is,

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:50.150
I wonder if I can keep going till the end.

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:51.860
Fool!

00:21:51.860 --> 00:21:53.120
Fool, aren't you here?

00:21:55.260 --> 00:21:56.590
Fool, tell me.

00:21:57.700 --> 00:21:58.490
No, I can't.

00:21:59.030 --> 00:21:59.930
But...

00:21:59.930 --> 00:22:01.540
I told you before.

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:05.010
When both of you are
qualified to do that maneuver,

00:22:05.010 --> 00:22:06.800
I will tell you everything.

00:22:09.810 --> 00:22:12.010
So, I'm not good enough yet?

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:14.910
I'm not? I'm not?

00:22:19.890 --> 00:22:21.860
Next Kaleido Star

00:22:22.620 --> 00:22:26.120
Can you tell me with confidence
that you're Layla's partner?

00:22:26.290 --> 00:22:28.960
And so, I'm training so hard, but...

00:22:28.960 --> 00:22:29.760
This is ridiculous!

00:22:29.760 --> 00:22:30.890
Sora is going to destroy herself!

00:22:31.170 --> 00:22:34.170
I will not look away.
I don't want to give up, but...

00:22:34.170 --> 00:22:35.860
I feel like crying.
I feel like running away.

00:22:36.140 --> 00:22:38.370
Miss Layla, please say something!

00:22:38.370 --> 00:22:39.460
Please! Please!

00:22:40.310 --> 00:22:42.100
Next time on Kaleido Star,

00:22:42.280 --> 00:22:42.580
"The Amazing Intensive Training Continues"

00:22:42.580 --> 00:22:45.110
The Amazing Intensive Training Continues

00:22:42.580 --> 00:22:45.110
"The Amazing Intensive Training Continues"

00:22:45.110 --> 00:22:45.250
The Amazing Intensive Training Continues

00:22:45.250 --> 00:22:47.580
The Amazing Intensive Training Continues

00:22:45.250 --> 00:22:47.580
My wings are my dream
and on towards the sky...

00:22:47.580 --> 00:22:47.710
My wings are my dream
and on towards the sky...

00:22:51.090 --> 00:23:03.930
<i>I'm here between the sky and the roads,
and facing against the wind</i>

00:22:51.090 --> 00:23:03.930
<i>Boku wa koko ni iru
sora to michi no aida de mukai kaze</i>

00:23:03.930 --> 00:23:17.710
<i>And I'm facing forward so the sorrow
doesn't rain down ever again</i>

00:23:03.930 --> 00:23:17.710
<i>Soshite mae o muiteiru,
mou nido to kanashimi ga furanai youni to</i>

00:23:17.710 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>I came all the way here after
I jumped over that wall</i>

00:23:17.710 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>Ano kabe o koete kokomade kitanda</i>

00:23:23.680 --> 00:23:30.960
<i>There are many times
when I just want to run away</i>

00:23:23.680 --> 00:23:30.960
<i>Nigedashitaku naru koto wa nando mo aru</i>

00:23:30.960 --> 00:23:36.300
<i>But I'm still here,
so, I'm not daunted that much</i>

00:23:30.960 --> 00:23:36.300
<i>Dakedo kokoni irunara taishite bibitte inai</i>

00:23:36.300 --> 00:23:43.740
<i>The poem I scribbled down, I can just
start writing over from the beginning</i>

00:23:36.300 --> 00:23:43.740
<i>Kakinaguri no uta "hajimekara yareba iisa"</i>

00:23:43.740 --> 00:23:50.110
<i>Unable to write it well, I'm laughing</i>

00:23:43.740 --> 00:23:50.110
<i>Umaku kakenaku te boku wa waratte iru</i>
